WEBVTT

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be. 

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. 

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. 

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! 

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid 

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself. 

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. 

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart! 

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. 

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really! 

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. 

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything! 

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be. 

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:53.500
What was that yesterday?

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:57.360
Was that really even me?

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:02.450
Maybe it was just a dream.

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:04.200
It wasn't a dream!

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.500
Your Character Transformation was so cool!

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:08.590
You were all like<i> jump, </i>and then it was like <i>ta-da!</i>

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:10.540
It was awesome!

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:12.500
Right, Amu-chan?

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:15.310
But what happened yesterday was your fault.

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:18.400
I like you, Prince!

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:19.830
I'm sorry.

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:25.260
The prince rejected me in front of everyone!

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:26.460
What should I do?

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:28.310
Don't worry! If at first you don't succ-

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:29.510
Shut up!

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:35.180
Being able to tell someone how I feel in front of so many people isn't me at all.

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:48.750
Episode 2
The Heart's Egg!

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.880
So that's what happened.

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:59.730
I don't want to go into the classroom.

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:07.660
I bet a ton of rumors about me are flying around now;

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:10.710
that I'm not who they thought, and how they never realized I'm so uncool.

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:14.450
Hinamori-san.

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:16.470
You were amazing yesterday.

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:19.400
Only you would be able to confess in front of such a crowd!

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:20.410
Yeah!

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:24.500
I have a feeling you two could really be compatible!

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:29.140
I always thought you were cool and collected, but I guess you have that side to you, too!

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:31.290
Oh, I see.

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:33.140
I see.

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.460
I see!

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:40.510
Excuse me.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:44.090
The Guardians' Queen's Chair: Fujisaki Nadeshiko-sama.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:45.220
She's so wonderful.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:47.590
The Royal Cape suits her perfectly.

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:49.680
But why is she here in Star Class?

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.950
You're Hinamori Amu-san, correct?

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:55.140
Yes...

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:58.800
We'll be waiting for you in the Royal Garden after school today.

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:02.240
The Royal Garden?

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:08.740
I also bring a message from Hotori-kun: "I'll tell you about the eggs."

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:10.980
Well then, I'll see you after school.

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:20.190
That's amazing, Hinamori-san! You've been invited to a tea party in the Royal Garden.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:21.020
A tea party?

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:23.460
Yeah, that's an invitation to one!

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:37.460
A tea party in the Royal Garden?

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:41.850
Well, I guess I do have to return something.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.260
Nothing I can do about it.

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:47.280
I'll get to see the prince again, at least.

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:49.700
Hey, what's a tea party?

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:52.270
You idiot! I told you not to come out!

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:55.390
I-It's o-kay.

00:04:56.720 --> 00:05:01.850
1, 2, 3, 4! 2, 2, 3, 4!

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:03.580
See, I told you it'd be fine.

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:06.570
Regular people can't see Guardian Characters.

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:08.390
Is that so?

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:12.920
The third-graders are doing the horizontal bar?

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:15.180
I'm not so good at it, either.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.940
Are you okay, Suzuki?

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:18.310
Y-Yeah.

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:22.960
Would anyone like to demonstrate to Suzuki how to rotate backward on the bar?

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:27.550
Hey, fifth-graders, could I trouble one of you?

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:30.060
Hinamori-san, what about you?

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:33.360
Yeah, you seem like you'd be good at anything.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:35.940
You've got it all wrong! I'm terrible at the horizontal bar!

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:37.810
Go for it, Amu-chan!

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:41.270
Okay, I'll do it!

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:43.790
Hinamori-senpai?

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:46.550
My body's moving on its own!

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:52.270
Go, go, Amu-chan! Go, go, Amu-chan!

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:55.080
You're doing great, Amu-chan!

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:06.290
I thought I said backward.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:14.970
Ran!

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:16.570
Now I'm pissed!

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:19.370
I'll flush you down the toilet so hard, you'll never do something like that again!

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:22.310
Everyone liked it, so who cares!

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:23.330
I do!

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:26.620
You can't go around changing people's personalities and rewriting who they are! It'd bug them!

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:28.120
Amu-chan.

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:45.470
Well, whatever. If you understand, get in the bag.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:49.750
We've got trouble, Amu-chan!

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:52.190
The blue egg is gone!

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:53.300
No way.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:56.210
Maybe you dropped it somewhere. We've gotta go look.

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:58.270
But my next class is about to start.

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.200
Then, after school!

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:01.800
After school?

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:07.140
We'll be waiting for you in the Royal Garden after school today.

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:11.810
I would have to miss the tea party.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.360
Amu-chan?

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:15.480
I've had enough.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:19.360
There's nothing good about you Guardian Characters.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.330
Actually, you guys are nothing but trouble.

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:22.330
Amu-chan, that's no-

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:25.380
Anyway, once I find the blue egg, it's good-bye.

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:28.120
I'd like you all to leave.

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:36.000
Arts and Crafts

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:43.870
A carnival overflowing with beauty; that's what the arts are about!

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:51.780
Hinamori-san, if you do not elegantly sketch my, Yamabuki Saya's, exquisite visage, I will <i>never</i> forgive you.

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:53.000
R-Right.

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:56.450
I guess I can't show her this.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:58.280
What's wrong?

00:07:58.330 --> 00:07:59.480
Nothing.

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:02.490
I just suck at art.

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:04.250
Then why don't you change?

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:08.970
Character Change: From a girl who can't draw well, to a girl who can draw anything!

00:08:13.190 --> 00:08:15.350
I-Is this me?

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.840
Ran, was that you again?

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:23.480
No! I'm only good at sports!

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.260
Then why did I...

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:28.690
There it is!

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:30.420
I-I'm going to the restroom!

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.450
Amu-chan, she's...

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:39.330
I know. She's the second Guardian Character, right?

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:43.350
Wait!

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:47.500
Wait!

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:54.020
Why are you running away? You're Amu-chan's Guardian Character, you know!

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:59.520
I'm Miki, someone Amu-chan wants to be.

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:02.510
But she's still uncertain and hesitating.

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:06.590
If Amu-chan doesn't believe in me, I'll disappear soon.

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:09.000
Disappear? No way.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.650
It's true.

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:15.200
If you don't believe in us, we'll disappear.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:20.060
That picture, what you did on the bar, were things you have the power to do.

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:22.530
It's your inner potential to be whoever you want to be.

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:27.770
So please, you just have to believe in us!

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:38.390
I don't really understand Guardian Characters, and you even get in the way.

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:42.510
But...

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:51.270
I guess it wouldn't hurt to believe in you, just a bit.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:54.290
Amu-chan!

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:56.480
Hey, I said just a bit!

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:58.520
You're coming, too.

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:03.590
It's going to look like I was in the bathroom forever. I don't want any misunderstandings.

00:10:04.310 --> 00:10:05.490
Okay!

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:15.530
Looks like Seiyo Academy is a pretty fun place.

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:32.100
The Humpty Lock responded to her.

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:38.730
Ikuto, who is that Amu girl, anyway? I've never heard of someone having three Guardian Eggs-nya.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:42.050
Maybe she's even carrying the Embryo-nya.

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:44.910
It's possible.

00:10:56.430 --> 00:10:57.830
Bye-bye.

00:10:57.890 --> 00:10:59.510
See you.

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:05.110
We finally get to have the tea party, Amu-chan.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:06.340
Yeah.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:09.660
But I'm so nervous!

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:13.620
Excuse me.

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:22.960
Wow.

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:27.850
Hello, Hinamori-san. Welcome to the Royal Garden.

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:37.250
Why do all the Guardians have Guardian Characters?

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:45.000
Today we'll be having maca tea. I've also baked some scones.

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:48.240
Yay! I love Nadeshiko's scones!

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.690
I guess we should start with introductions.

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:56.600
The Guardians' King's Chair: Hotori Tadase. I'm in the fifth grade, like you.

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:59.520
My Guardian Character's name is Kiseki.

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:05.370
The Queen's Chair: Fujisaki Nadeshiko. I'm also a fifth-grader. She is Temari.

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:09.870
The Ace's Chair: Yuiki Yaya, I'm in the fourth grade. I like anything and everything cute!

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:12.080
This is Pepe-chan. Nice to meet you!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:17.530
The Jack's Chair: Soma Kukai. I'm a sixth-grader. I'm also Captain of the soccer team.

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:19.080
This is Daichi.

00:12:19.390 --> 00:12:21.570
U-Um, I am...

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:25.260
We know everything about you, Hinamori Amu-san.

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:28.450
You're actually shy, how cute!

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:30.920
We also know that you're bad with scary stories.

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:33.190
H-How do you know about that?

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:37.380
It's the Guardians' responsibility to look after the students' personal information.

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:38.280
Yep. Yep.

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:40.610
Isn't that the same as invading their privacy?!

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:46.080
And we also know your Guardian Characters, Ran and Miki.

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:49.960
What are Guardian Characters, anyway?

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:51.920
Look at this.

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:53.280
A picture book?

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:56.030
The Heart's Egg.

00:12:57.560 --> 00:13:01.630
Every child has an egg within their soul.

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:04.380
This heart's egg cannot be seen with one's eyes.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:07.240
But as the child grows up, it vanishes.

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:11.260
Huh? A page was torn out.

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:17.530
This book was written by the Guardians' Founding King.

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:21.250
The heart's egg. Don't you think that sounds familiar?

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:31.920
Yep, there's an egg in every kid's heart. But sometimes the egg is strange, and another you comes out of it.

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:34.020
That's basically what Guardian Characters are.

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:36.820
Another me?

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:43.360
We Guardians are all Character Bearers, and we've inherited these positions generation after generation.

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:47.980
That's why, Hinamori Amu-san, we would like you to join the Guardians.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:51.360
Join the Guardians? So I'd be with the prince?

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:58.000
The heart's egg usually rests safely inside a person's heart.

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:05.080
But at times, the person carrying the egg experiences some type of trauma, and they punish their own heart.

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:09.550
When that happens, it becomes an X Egg.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:11.930
An X Egg?

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:16.070
When that happens, I'm sure your Character Transformation will be really useful!

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:16.920
Yep.

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:19.750
No one else here can do them, after all.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:22.000
I want to see a Character Transformation!

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:27.660
A Character Transformation? That just happened on its own; I don't even know how I did it, myself!

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:31.750
Will you become a Guardian?

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:34.260
Um...

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:35.520
Um?

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:36.800
No!

00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:41.020
Why not?

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:43.670
As a Guardian, you'd get a whole bunch of special privileges!

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:48.470
B-Because I don't really want to wear the Royal Cape.

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.000
The cape?

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:53.280
That's it?

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:54.900
It's important!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:58.370
No matter how you look at it, it goes against my fashion philosophy and sense of style!

00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:01.290
What's up with this girl? She's hilarious.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.340
You pass.

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:03.620
Congratulations, Guardian!

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:04.010
I told you I wasn't joining!

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:05.850
No matter what?

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:09.050
I'm sorry!

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:10.970
Amu-chan!

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:15.550
She really is great!

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:20.280
Was it really okay to turn them down?

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:23.920
It's fine. I just started getting friendly with the rest of my class.

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:27.380
If I joined the Guardians I'd obviously start drifting away from them again.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.490
I'm fine with being normal! Normal is good!

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:32.260
You're back to being stubborn again.

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:35.050
You finally had a chance to get in good with the prince, though.

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:36.960
Well, it's all a misunderstanding.

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:39.800
There's no way I have some sort of special power.

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:41.970
What's wrong?

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:44.540
Crap, I forgot to give this back.

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:45.810
What should I do?

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:55.640
It's that boy.

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:57.510
He's trying hard, isn't he?

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:00.850
Ah, Hinamori-senpai.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:06.950
You saw me doing something embarrassing.

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:09.340
I'm sorry, Hinamori-senpai.

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:11.870
You really don't need to apologize.

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:18.400
I don't have the right to be a fan of the "cool & spicy" Hinamori-senpai the way I am, do I?

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:20.380
Huh? What are you saying?

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:22.950
Well, I have zero athletic ability.

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:27.350
I'm clumsy, too, and to make matters worse, people say I act like an old man for my age.

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:43.850
I don't think my dream will come true, anyway.

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:46.370
You have a dream? What kind?

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:49.760
I want to have the best grades in the school.

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:54.060
And someday, I'd like to be the president of an IT company, or a charismatic programmer.

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:55.290
But...

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:56.760
But?

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:59.440
It's obvious that'll never happen.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:16.530
What is that?

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:17.570
Is that...

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:18.830
Maybe it's an...

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:20.270
X Egg!

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:22.660
No way!

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:31.440
I'm worthless.

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:34.960
Hinamori-senpai, I'm sure you think I'm pathetic, too.

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:36.490
I don't!

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:38.300
Yes, you do!

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:44.800
My dream is impossible.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:49.930
Impossible. Impossible. Impossible. Impossible. Impossible.

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:51.290
What's impossible?

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:55.250
You have to believe in yourself, or else your dream will vanish before your eyes!

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:01.500
It's way too soon for you to do nothing but give up!

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:11.520
What's that?

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:14.040
That light! It couldn't be!

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:15.430
Hey, Tadase!

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:19.260
My heart: Unlock!

00:18:57.080 --> 00:18:59.800
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:07.450
No way! I transformed again!

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:09.110
Wow.

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:12.920
Cool! It's a Character Transformation!

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:16.060
Impossible!

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:23.670
Amu-chan, it's okay! We can do it!

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:25.260
Do it? But...

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:29.500
Don't you feel it? The power is getting stronger!

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:33.010
It's true. The power's...

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:38.000
Negative Heart:

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:40.660
Lock On!

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:48.320
Open Heart!

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:02.260
The X Egg went back to normal.

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:05.970
That was great, Amu-chan!

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:10.710
What was that? Something came out of my hands and... This is not happening!

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:12.690
But it was pretty cool.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:29.370
Huh, why am I...

00:20:29.510 --> 00:20:31.210
Hinamori-senpai?

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:34.900
You know, I'm not so different from you.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:42.110
I get freaked out all the time and I'm really indecisive, so I wouldn't think for one second that you're worthless!

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:43.760
Hinamori-senpai.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:46.430
I'm moved! I'm inspired!

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:49.540
I definitely just felt your spicy power!

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:54.900
I suddenly feel full of energy now!

00:20:55.400 --> 00:21:00.080
I'll show you I can be top of the class, an IT president <i>and</i> a charismatic programmer!

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:05.320
No, more than that, more than anything else, I want to remain your #1 fan!

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:10.870
Farewell, senpai! Have a nice day! My name is Suzu-

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:13.260
Oh crap. I overdid it.

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:16.320
Hey, Hinamori!

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:18.080
T-The Guardians.

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:20.580
Were you watching?

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:21.630
Of course.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:23.350
Cool Character Transformation!

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:25.650
Hinamori-san, you really are...

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:30.000
N-No! It was just a coincidence! You've got it all wrong! That wasn't me at all!

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:30.860
Think she'll leave?

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:31.920
She'll leave.

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:34.380
I-I'm sorry!

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:36.090
She left! She left!

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:37.750
See you next time!

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:40.200
I guess her coming was unexpected.

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:42.320
What will you do, Fujisaki-san?

00:21:42.640 --> 00:21:46.710
You shouldn't have to ask. A Guardian wouldn't leave things like this.

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:51.480
Today was so much fun!

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:55.350
It's so awesome doing a Character Transformation with you! Right?

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:56.710
N-Not really.

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:58.060
You're not cute at all.

00:21:58.260 --> 00:21:59.280
Neither are you.

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:00.380
Stubborn.

00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:01.470
Weirdo.

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:04.780
Hey! Hold up!

00:22:04.850 --> 00:22:06.210
I'm over here!

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:07.060
Miki!

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:09.650
Amu-chan, over here!

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:11.000
You, too?

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:14.480
I might be stubborn, cynical and a scaredy-cat,

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:18.420
but I guess that's not such a bad thing.

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:41.290
As long as I exist, even when I'm a pile of dust, 

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:47.690
I'll keep cheering "you can do it, you can do it" out loud! 

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:48.510
(You can do it!)

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:54.670
I'll never stop as long as I live,  

00:22:54.670 --> 00:23:01.020
so I'll sing my never-ending song. 

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:05.530
I'll press forward down my path. 

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:09.050
Even random characters have their merits. 

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:13.890
You might be worthless, but I'll still love you, 

00:23:13.890 --> 00:23:15.360
my darling.

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:19.150
You idiot! My true self... 

00:23:19.150 --> 00:23:22.110
Just say what's on your mind. 

00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:25.540
You're sticking out a little. 

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:28.810
You're coming closer to my dream. 

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:32.590
You jerk! My true self... 

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.840
Please come out, don't hide. 

00:23:36.840 --> 00:23:41.780
Oh yeah! Right now! 

00:23:50.650 --> 00:23:53.860
I'm just letting you know, that wasn't me at all!

00:23:53.910 --> 00:23:56.760
There's no way I'd have some weird light thing.

00:23:56.810 --> 00:24:00.010
Open Heart is your power, Amu-chan!

00:24:00.050 --> 00:24:01.260
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:24:01.290 --> 00:24:06.410
This looks fun! I want to join you guys soon!

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:07.480
Who was that?

00:24:07.520 --> 00:24:08.600
Maybe it was...

00:24:08.660 --> 00:24:10.510
The third Guardian Character?

00:24:10.560 --> 00:24:14.380
Next time on Shugo Chara: Flaky and Fluffy! Leave it to Su!

00:24:14.420 --> 00:24:15.260
Let's have fun...

00:24:15.310 --> 00:24:16.090
...again.

00:24:16.120 --> 00:24:17.020
Yeah!

00:24:17.080 --> 00:24:19.100
Give me a break already!
